ic, Hyatt Vacation Club, Hyatt, Caption by Hyatt, Unscripted by Hyatt, Hyatt Place, Hyatt House, Hyatt Studios, Hyatt Select, and UrCove brands. The company also offers Homes & Hideaways by World of Hyatt, a short-term vacation rental platform that features direct booking for short-term private home rentals in the United States, as well as distribution and destination management services; and World of Hyatt loyalty program, which allows rewards points to be redeemed for hotel nights and other rewards. It serves corporations; national, state, and regional associations; specialty market accounts, including social, government, military, educational, religious, and fraternal organizations; travel agency and luxury organizations; and a group of individual consumers. It has a long-term strategic loyalty collaboration with Delta Air Lines to add highly sought after benefits for members. Hyatt Hotels Corporation was founded in 1957 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois.","employees":50000,"website":"https://www.hyatt.com","country":"United States","city":"Chicago","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Mark Samuel Hoplamazian","title":"President, CEO & Chairman of the Board"},{"name":"Ms. Joan L. Bottarini","title":"Executive VP & CFO"},{"name":"Mr. Mark R. Vondrasek","title":"Executive VP & Chief Commercial Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":14.89,"tpe":19.76,"ps":1.232,"pfcf":19.43,"peg":1.15,"pb":2.911,"ev_ebitda":11.9,"rev_growth":0.0545,"eps_growth":0.167,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1094,"eps_growth_next":0.1251,"div_yield":0.0077,"roe":0.1514,"roa":0.06079,"de":107.2,"gross_margin":0.3789,"op_margin":0.09692,"profit_margin":0.0585,"current_ratio":1.444},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":37.68,"sector":14.89,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":97.09,"sector":19.76,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":5.327,"sector":1.232,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":89.62,"sector":19.43,"verdict":"Overvalued"}